  "content": "<h3><strong>警</strong><strong>告：此模组包含巨型实体，因此</strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong> <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">巨物恐懼症</span></span></em> </strong></span><strong>玩家</strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\">請勿遊玩</span> </strong></span><strong>。同樣地，</strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><em>癲癇症</em></span><em> </em></strong></span><strong>玩家也請注意。<br><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#b96ad9\"><em>我不建議在2.0版本中進行多人遊戲，可能導致崩潰、錯誤或卡頓！！！</em></span></strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#bfedd2\"><strong>靈感來自 KHANHSKMC 的 SUNMAN 影片</strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>頁面連結：<br><br>原始模組頁面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fthe-sun-town-doctor-nowhere%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/the-sun-town-doctor-nowhere/</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Modrinth 頁面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-sun-town\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/the-sun-town</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>附加包移植：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/doctor-nowhere-sun-town-bedrock-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/doctor-nowhere-sun-town-bedrock-edition</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://minecraftonly.com/uploads/posts/2025-09/1757083236_meijun.png\" alt=\"MinecraftOnly 上的最新方塊模組 1.16.5 forge » 第8頁\"></strong></a></p><p><strong>在你的世界中增加了 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>3</em></span> 種會追獵你血肉的實體...</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1;text-decoration:underline\">關於模組</span></span>：</strong><br>第一天，你存活；夜晚，你會看到一個以太陽為頭的巨大身影...<br>這是一個巨大的「無處博士」生物，會跟蹤你並在近距離攻擊你...<br>它極度危險，能一擊殺死你，並追逐你的靈魂...<br>有時...它會導致你的遊戲崩潰...</p><p><br>實體列表：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><strong>第一個是長男盆栽，身高10米的傢伙</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1514467/description_e8a8bfdb-e3fa-49e2-9ac9-009b8679828d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"463\" height=\"486\"><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><strong>第二個是傑皮·喬瑟斯，身高3米的傢伙</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1514467/description_e1c26c20-c9cb-4949-b99d-93846a079c4b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"368\" height=\"422\"><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><strong>第三個是<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#451711\">太陽人</span>...身高25格方塊的傢伙</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1514467/description_f101d5fd-b04d-48c5-bb33-754de33d33ce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"966\"></strong></em></span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><br>去觀看<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">VIVILLY</span></strong></span>的這部影片：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KgODoZcIPqw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KgODoZcIPqw</a><br><br><br>靈感來自<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@doctornowhere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dr. Nowhere / Silas Orion</a>&nbsp;</span>藝術家以及<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2mYbo059yOk&amp;t\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KhanhsKMC YouTuber Sunman</a><br>製作人：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">hopal228</span> + <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCreator</a><br>音效提供：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#bfedd2\"><em><strong>AblestormMC/EnableTheStormsMC</strong></em></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>另外，也來看看我另一個基於 Dr. Nowhere 的模組！連結：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boiled-one\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boiled-one</a></strong></p><p><br>我的YouTube頻道：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hopal228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@hopal228</a></p><p><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>!!!請勿盜用我的模型!!!</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝您的理解!!!</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">學術自由許可證（AFL）v.3.0 / 版權所有</span></h6>",
